# NOTE: apps/stow-app/src-tauri/gen/schemas (Tauri capability JSON schemas) is
# tracked on purpose: capabilities/*.json reference it via "$schema", and CI
# should not need a Tauri build to validate them. Do not ignore `gen/`.
